cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeodesyKit in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "GeodesyKit: A Modern C++ Geodesy Toolkit"
abstract: >
  GeodesyKit is a lightweight, header-only C++17 library for high-precision
  geodetic computations on the WGS84 ellipsoid. It provides accurate
  ECEF-to-geodetic coordinate conversion using Vermeille's method, geodesic
  distance and azimuth computation via Karney's algorithm (with a Vincenty
  fallback), and weighted least-squares 3D triangulation from bearing
  observations with Tikhonov regularization.
